  quarrel.push(format!(\"state {} tok {}\", idx, a));\r\n/app/ovenpit/oven.rs:304:    fs::write(format!(\"{}/quarrel.lst\", out), quarrel.join(\"\\n\")).unwrap();\r\n/app/ovenpit/oven.rs:305:    if rib_a(quarrel.len()) != 0 {\r\n/app/ovenpit/oven.rs:308:    fs::write(format!(\"{}/action.tbl\", out), alines).unwrap();\r\n/app/drawbin/FRONT.txt:1:drawbin is the sift front.\r\n/app/drawbin/usage.txt:1:usage: riftkiln sift SRC DEST\r\n"]
